{"2876200":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"eXoSpace Combat Engineer","steam_appid":2876200,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Community<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/fd1a5e5f8c7827ceebc5191f35439861.avif?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=124 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>게임 정보<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer<\/strong> is inspired by <strong>Reassembly<\/strong>, <strong>Nova Drift<\/strong> and <strong>FTL<\/strong>. It is a mission-based spaceship building game with bullet-hell style combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/b01b77a4f4a50f6f531dde6290a6ad2e.webp?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=48 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.poster.avif?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.mp4?t=1780653154\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an intuitive snap-and-rotate system to build your ultimate warship. Balance thrusters, armor, and energy systems, or use advanced mechanical parts like <strong>pistons and hinges<\/strong> to create transforming warships.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spaceship designer is<strong> gridless<\/strong>, allowing you to snap parts together in any orientation, and has plenty of quality of life features. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/38dbb036f29836a4521ff129d201fa7c.webp?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=48 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.poster.avif?t=1780653154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.mp4?t=1780653154\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the ranks of the eXoSpace Combat Engineers by taking out bosses deep in dangerous areas of space. Each hyperjump brings you closer to your target. Each hyperjump brings a new encounter: an asteroid storm, a pirate ambush, or even a hitchhiker looking for a ride. Who knows what will happen next? You will need to evolve your ship from a small drone to a true dreadnaught to face all bosses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/483de961ef66d48d77965170e53f840a.webp?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=48 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying game loop:<\/strong> gather resources and tech to upgrade your ship. Complete missions to increase in rank, improve your crew and build even bigger ships in your hunt for the most dangerous of criminals.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gridless spaceship designer<\/strong> that lets you easily snap parts together in any angle, allowing you to quickly try out new designs or upgrade your ship.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive engineering constraints<\/strong>: balance thrusters, weapons, energy and armor to create an effective warship.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-hell boss fights<\/strong>: each mission ends with an epic phased boss-fight. Find weak points while dodging projectiles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully-featured<\/strong> <strong>sandbox<\/strong> allowing you to build any ship, create your own faction, and share it with a click on the Steam Workshop. Fight intense battles, and set up endless waves of invading enemies for complete chaos. You can even <strong>build your own boss<\/strong>!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get challenged in the Arena<\/strong>: face design and piloting challenges ranging from 1 vs 1 drone skirmishes to cruiser battles. Or create your own arena and share it on the Workshop.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 600 different ship designs to discover<\/strong>, including many community creations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 200 parts <\/strong>to build your ship with, including powerful faction-specific weapons.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 playable factions<\/strong> with their own tech tree, powerful unique parts, and crew.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more is added in <strong>regular updates<\/strong>!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>User Praise:<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This game feels like Reassembly if it was designed as a game, first and foremost, instead of a shipbuilding sandbox.&quot;<\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I like how here, I can quickly design something and experiment. I can iterate quickly and comfortably.&quot;<\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“This game is ingenious, amazing and AWESOME! Something that fills the gap between Reassembly, Cosmoteer and Starsector.”<\/i><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is developed by Bas (@ Fantastimaker), a solo developer.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer<\/strong> is inspired by <strong>Reassembly<\/strong>, <strong>Nova Drift<\/strong> and <strong>FTL<\/strong>. It is a mission-based spaceship building game with bullet-hell style combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/b01b77a4f4a50f6f531dde6290a6ad2e.webp?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=48 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.poster.avif?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.mp4?t=1780653154\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an intuitive snap-and-rotate system to build your ultimate warship. Balance thrusters, armor, and energy systems, or use advanced mechanical parts like <strong>pistons and hinges<\/strong> to create transforming warships.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spaceship designer is<strong> gridless<\/strong>, allowing you to snap parts together in any orientation, and has plenty of quality of life features. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/38dbb036f29836a4521ff129d201fa7c.webp?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=48 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.poster.avif?t=1780653154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.mp4?t=1780653154\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the ranks of the eXoSpace Combat Engineers by taking out bosses deep in dangerous areas of space. Each hyperjump brings you closer to your target. Each hyperjump brings a new encounter: an asteroid storm, a pirate ambush, or even a hitchhiker looking for a ride. Who knows what will happen next? You will need to evolve your ship from a small drone to a true dreadnaught to face all bosses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/extras\/483de961ef66d48d77965170e53f840a.webp?t=1780653154\" width=780 height=48 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying game loop:<\/strong> gather resources and tech to upgrade your ship. Complete missions to increase in rank, improve your crew and build even bigger ships in your hunt for the most dangerous of criminals.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gridless spaceship designer<\/strong> that lets you easily snap parts together in any angle, allowing you to quickly try out new designs or upgrade your ship.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive engineering constraints<\/strong>: balance thrusters, weapons, energy and armor to create an effective warship.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-hell boss fights<\/strong>: each mission ends with an epic phased boss-fight. Find weak points while dodging projectiles.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully-featured<\/strong> <strong>sandbox<\/strong> allowing you to build any ship, create your own faction, and share it with a click on the Steam Workshop. Fight intense battles, and set up endless waves of invading enemies for complete chaos. You can even <strong>build your own boss<\/strong>!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get challenged in the Arena<\/strong>: face design and piloting challenges ranging from 1 vs 1 drone skirmishes to cruiser battles. Or create your own arena and share it on the Workshop.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 600 different ship designs to discover<\/strong>, including many community creations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 200 parts <\/strong>to build your ship with, including powerful faction-specific weapons.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 playable factions<\/strong> with their own tech tree, powerful unique parts, and crew.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more is added in <strong>regular updates<\/strong>!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>User Praise:<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This game feels like Reassembly if it was designed as a game, first and foremost, instead of a shipbuilding sandbox.&quot;<\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I like how here, I can quickly design something and experiment. I can iterate quickly and comfortably.&quot;<\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“This game is ingenious, amazing and AWESOME! Something that fills the gap between Reassembly, Cosmoteer and Starsector.”<\/i><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is developed by Bas (@ Fantastimaker), a solo developer.<\/p>","short_description":"Build your warship and explore a galaxy full of unpredictable encounters. Master bullet-hell combat and survive multi-phased boss fights to take down your targets. Evolve from a simple fighter into a true dreadnought as you hunt down the galaxy's most wanted!","supported_languages":"영어, 네덜란드어","reviews":"“I really like it!”<br>Stealth17 Gaming<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/8a8f9a6293c9d25b0929a9a4a1df6d7ca8af7d6c\/header.jpg?t=1780653154","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780653154","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2876200\/0c6cb0eb4c88ca735407ea4aee052f591ef724c3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780653154","website":"https:\/\/exospace-combat-engineer.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Microsoft Windows 10, 11, or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 2 GHz Dual Core<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> DirectX 12, OpenGL ES or Vulkan<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 500 MB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Microsoft Windows 10, 11, or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Quad-core Intel 2.5 GHz (or AMD equivalent) or better<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> 2GB DirectX 11 Graphics Card or better<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 1 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul clas